# Local environment template for the Predictive Complaint Risk Intelligence Platform.
#
# Copy this file to .env when the project starts reading settings.
# Do not put secrets in this file. .env is gitignored; this example is not.
#
# The repository foundation does not read environment variables yet.
# Paths default to directories inside the repository (see complaint_risk.config).
# When a setting is introduced, document it here before code starts using it.
#
# Example of the form a later setting will take (not read today):
# COMPLAINT_RISK_RAW_DATA_DIR=data/raw
